## ✅ Verification & CI

### Verification

| Тест | Тайлбар |
|---|---|
| **bit_exact** | zsfm output vs PyTorch reference, tolerance ≤ 1e-5 |
| **gguf_smoke** | Load each Q8_0 GGUF, run 1 inference, assert shape |
| **checksum_verify_on_start** | SHA256SUMS + manifest.json |
| **golden features** | Deterministic (seeded) feature outputs |

### CI workflows

```yaml
- cargo fmt --check
- cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings
- cargo test --workspace
- cargo build --release --features cuda
- cargo build --release --features metal
- cargo deny check
- cargo audit
- bit_exact test
- gguf_smoke test
```

### Supply chain

- `cargo-deny` ≥ 0.16 — yanked/unmaintained deny, duplicate warn
- `cargo-audit` ≥ 0.20
